{"id":"d3d8e252a3a45dba","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibre-finite-limits.md","title":"纤维有限极限","display":"df-fibrewise-finite-limits — 纤维有限极限","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibre-finite-limits","aliases":["16-df-fibre-finite-limits","Fibrewise finite limits"],"display":"df-fibrewise-finite-limits — 纤维有限极限","depends_on":["[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-substitution]]","[[16-df-fibre]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"§1.8 and Chapter 9, fibred limits; Theorem 10.5.10","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibre-finite-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibre-finite-limits</span><span>Fibrewise finite limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibrewise-finite-limits — 纤维有限极限"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.8 and Chapter 9, fibred limits; Theorem 10.5.10"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 的重索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>，纤维采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J\">\\(D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*D=u^*\\circ D\">\\(u^*D=u^*\\circ D\\)</span>；对锥分量族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(\\lambda_k)_k\">\\(\\lambda=(\\lambda_k)_k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\\lambda=(u^*\\lambda_k)_k\">\\(u^*\\lambda=(u^*\\lambda_k)_k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinLim}\\)</span> 是下文定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinLim}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall K)\\Bigl[\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\forall D)\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinLim}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall K)\\Bigl[\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\forall D)\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限性与极限锥的目标纤维都有显式参数；没有用排版中的英文“finite”替代论域限制。</li>\n<li>每个纤维具有有限极限，且每个重索引函子保持其泛性质。可等价检查终对象、二元积和等化子及相应规范比较；单写对象存在不足以断言泛性质。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §1.8、Chapter 9 的 fibred limits；Theorem 10.5.10。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，纤维采用 [[16-df-fibre]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，纤维采用 [[16-df-fibre]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)$、$\\mathrm{FinLim}$、$\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)$、$\\mathrm{FinLim}$、$\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)","display":false},{"tex":"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*D=u^*\\circ D","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(\\lambda_k)_k","display":false},{"tex":"u^*\\lambda=(u^*\\lambda_k)_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinLim}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall K)\\Bigl[\\mathrm{FinCat}(K)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\forall D)\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}(D,K,\\mathcal E_J)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2068,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"451bab4ec81f7acd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。固定Grothendieck宇宙 $\\mathcal U$，小指标范畴 $K$ 满足其对象、态射集属于 $\\mathcal U$。极限锥 $\\mathrm{LimCone}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]] 中的通用锥泛性质，不加 $K$ 有限的限制。$D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 是函子，$u^*D,u^*\\lambda$ 采用 [[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75e7c168ac56b22","ccfbb871fa39931c","aa1ce0bab1ae8910","fc49efccd7348d66"]}